                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "WebClient client = WebClient.builder()\n\t\t.filter((request, next) -> {\n\t\t\tOptional<Object> usr = request.attribute(\"myAttribute\");\n\t\t\t// ...\n\t\t})\n\t\t.build();\n\nclient.get().uri(\"https://example.org/\")\n\t\t.attribute(\"myAttribute\", \"...\")\n\t\t.retrieve()\n\t\t.bodyToMono(Void.class);\n\n\t}"
